// Taud instrument data model — port of AudioAdapter.kt TaudInstEnvPoint (5246),
// TaudInstPatch (5261), MetaLayer (5312), TaudInst (5378-5766).
// Envelope point `offset` is the ThreeFiveMiniUfloat LUT index (0..255);
